Package: com.voring.regionshotbridge
Name: RegionShotBridge
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: URL scheme bridge for RegionShot. Open regionshot://shot to trigger the tweak's default screenshot (reload via regionshot://reload).
Maintainer: Voring
Author: Voring
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), com.moxuan.regionshot
